WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.859 --> 00:00:03.629
Speaker 1: This is a very personal story for
me.

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:04.629
I'm kind of getting.

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:08.970
But people know I'm supposed to go to a wedding
in Italy in early September.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.919
And I've been wondering, will Americans be
allowed in?

00:00:12.919 --> 00:00:18.350
The Washington Post is now reporting that
the European Union will be reopening their

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:24.980
borders to the vaccinated American population
very, very soon.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:31.289
The European Union announced this morning
that they will be opening the borders to vaccinated

00:00:31.289 --> 00:00:37.829
Americans after more than a year during which
travel has been significantly restricted.

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:42.760
This is a Washington Post report which says
the decision will throw open Europe's doors

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:47.810
to tourists, business and other travel after
a long stretch in which most of those from

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.910
outside the 27 nation bloc have not been allowed
in.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.399
It will hearten those.

00:00:53.399 --> 00:00:55.350
I am feeling heartened, I admit it.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:01:01.120
It will hearten those who have missed wandering
the continent's ancient streets, as well as

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:05.230
Europeans whose livelihoods depends on tourist
cash.

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:09.070
One final round of approvals is necessary
in the coming days, but the sign off is no

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:10.220
longer in doubt.

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.020
The plan was agreed upon by ambassadors today.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:18.310
The timing of when borders will actually open
is not yet clear, but it could be within days

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:21.320
and certainly by the end of June.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:26.860
The European Council, quote now recommends
that that member states ease restrictions,

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:31.369
in particular for those with an EU authorized
vaccine.

00:01:31.369 --> 00:01:37.080
That would mean all of the vaccines authorized
in the US would get the green light.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:43.150
But vaccines currently manufactured in Russia
and China, that's the Sputnik and the Sinovel

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:48.549
vaccine would not, at least at this time,
qualify you for entry to the European Union.

00:01:48.549 --> 00:01:52.330
This guidance from the European Union is not
binding, meaning a country could say we're

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:56.090
not letting anybody in or a country could
say, we'll let people in with the Sputnik

00:01:56.090 --> 00:02:00.670
vaccine or the Sino vaccine or the BLETCH
injections or whatever they want to do.

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:03.540
But this is the guidance from the European
Union.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:06.869
It has been a massive struggle in Europe.

00:02:06.869 --> 00:02:10.160
Greece open relatively early.

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:12.330
Croatia is open.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:18.390
Estonia, there are way I mean, listen, if
the truth is if you're determined to go somewhere,

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:20.020
